  "body": "This 1970s complex has long been a favourite with first-home buyers and investors alike, and it's easy to see why. Our vendors have called it home for over 13 years, first to live in, then as a rock-solid investment.\r\n\r\nThis ground-floor apartment gets the fundamentals right. Two well-proportioned bedrooms give you room to move, whether it's guests, a home office, extra storage, or whatever life throws at you. Off-street parking sits right at your door, because nobody wants to trek home laden with groceries.\r\n\r\nThen there's the patio. West-facing, sun-drenched, and flowing straight off the living room, it's the kind of space that turns a quick coffee into a lazy afternoon. Fully fenced too, so little ones can run free while you relax.\r\n\r\nLocation-wise, you're spoiled. Devonport village is walking distance, and so are some of the North Shore's best beaches. An active body corporate keeps the building and grounds immaculate, so lock-up-and-leave living is a genuine reality.\r\n\r\nPlease call now to make an appointment to view.",
